  m_text: 'Four players and one board of cards. Everyone picks a card each round!



    High-value
    cards are worth more, but if your rivals grab the same one, you''ll split the
    points!



    Be the only one to snatch the Special Card to steal 5 points from
    the leader, or gain 5 points if you''re already in the lead!



    The game
    ends when the cards run out, or a player reaches 20 points. Highest score wins!'
